        "created_at": "2020-11-20T18:32:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For anyone who checks the forums more than Kickstarter Maggie (GtG Communications Director / Goth Miner) has said that we have about a week to lock in our addresses for delivery (Brazilians also need to send them a number, you would know what it was if you have one)</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/66c060d3618775d2a9d064051e288b7dd4965ba4.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"192\" height=\"192\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.backerkit.com/backer_accounts/sign_in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">BackerKit</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/362;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/35154ce76fbe2826d4088e740e6fc39ab3d4a1c7_2_690x362.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" srcset=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/35154ce76fbe2826d4088e740e6fc39ab3d4a1c7_2_690x362.jpeg, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/35154ce76fbe2826d4088e740e6fc39ab3d4a1c7_2_1035x543.jpeg 1.5x, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/35154ce76fbe2826d4088e740e6fc39ab3d4a1c7.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/35154ce76fbe2826d4088e740e6fc39ab3d4a1c7_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.backerkit.com/backer_accounts/sign_in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">BackerKit | Log into your Backer Account</a></h3>\n\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>the above is how i check all my KS projects on Backer Kit</p>",
